{"seq":1,"slug":"fog-rendering","title":"迷雾渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/practice/fog-rendering","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"迷雾渲染\">迷雾渲染</h1><p>玩家永远不会看到三态网格里那些 0 和 1，他们看到的是屏幕上一层会呼吸的灰纱：边缘柔和、可见区明亮、记忆区灰暗、视野移动时缓缓过渡而非硬切。把一张离散的可见性网格变成这层视觉效果，是迷雾系统给到玩家的最后一公里。本篇讲迷雾渲染的工程做法：用低分辨率可见性纹理加双线性采样得到柔和边缘、用时间平滑让视野过渡呼吸、以及如何在着色器里把三态混成连续的明暗。它把 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a> 的离散状态翻译成像素，与 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/framing-control/framing-composition\">相机系统（33）</a> 的取景分工明确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>迷雾渲染的主线是把可见性数据搬上 GPU 当一张<strong>可见性纹理</strong>，再在迷雾着色器里采样它、混合出每个像素的明暗。纹理通常远低于屏幕分辨率（比如一格地图对应一个纹素），靠 GPU 的双线性采样自动在格间插值，把方格状的离散可见性变成平滑梯度。三态被编码进纹理通道：一个通道存「当前可见度」，一个存「是否已探索」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[CPU/GPU 可见性数据] --&gt; B[写入低分辨率可见性纹理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[R 通道: 当前可见度 0..1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[G 通道: 已探索 0/1]&#10;    C --&gt; E[迷雾着色器采样]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[双线性插值 柔和边缘]&#10;    F --&gt; G[时间平滑 呼吸过渡]&#10;    G --&gt; H[混合: 可见亮/已探索灰/未探索黑]\">flowchart TD\n    A[CPU/GPU 可见性数据] --&gt; B[写入低分辨率可见性纹理]\n    B --&gt; C[R 通道: 当前可见度 0..1]\n    B --&gt; D[G 通道: 已探索 0/1]\n    C --&gt; E[迷雾着色器采样]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[双线性插值 柔和边缘]\n    F --&gt; G[时间平滑 呼吸过渡]\n    G --&gt; H[混合: 可见亮/已探索灰/未探索黑]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渲染要素</th>\n<th>技术手段</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>柔和边缘</td>\n<td>低分辨率纹理 + 双线性采样</td>\n<td>消除方格锯齿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平滑过渡</td>\n<td>帧间时间插值（lerp）</td>\n<td>视野移动不硬切</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三态明暗</td>\n<td>通道编码 + 着色器混合</td>\n<td>区分可见/记忆/未知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰减呼吸</td>\n<td>指数衰减可见度</td>\n<td>视野离开不突变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可见性纹理与双线性采样\">可见性纹理与双线性采样</h2><p>直接把每格可见性画成一个方块，会得到马赛克边缘，丑且暴露网格分辨率。标准解法是把可见性写进一张纹理，每格对应一个纹素，然后让 GPU 在采样时做<strong>双线性插值</strong>：屏幕上某点的可见度，由它落在的纹素四角按距离加权平均得出。这样格与格之间的硬边界被自然抹成梯度，半格宽的过渡带让迷雾边缘柔和。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> 角</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(p) = \\sum_{i \\in \\{4\\text{ 角}\\}} w_i \\, v_i, \\qquad \\sum_i w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">角</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分辨率是个旋钮：纹理越接近地图格数，边缘越「贴」地形但越硬；纹理可以比格数更粗（一个纹素覆盖几格）以获得更柔的雾，但会糊掉细节。很多游戏还在双线性之上叠一层噪声纹理，让迷雾边缘有不规则的卷曲感而非数学般的平滑。这张可见性纹理可以直接复用 <a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 在 GPU 上累加出的结果，省去 CPU 回传。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间平滑-让视野呼吸\">时间平滑：让视野呼吸</h2><p>视野移动时，若每帧用当前可见性硬替换，玩家会看到迷雾边缘「跳格」——一格一格地亮灭，廉价而刺眼。<strong>时间平滑</strong>让显示的可见度向目标值缓动，而非瞬间到达。每帧：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>显示</mtext></msub><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>显示</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>目标</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>显示</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{显示}} \\leftarrow v_{\\text{显示}} + (v_{\\text{目标}} - v_{\\text{显示}}) \\cdot (1 - e^{-\\Delta t / \\tau})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">显示</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">显示</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">目标</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">显示</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是过渡时间常数。视野进入某格时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>目标</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{目标}}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">目标</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，显示值快速但平滑地升起；视野离开时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>目标</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{目标}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">目标</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到「已探索」的灰度，显示值缓缓沉下。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-of-war-types\">战争迷雾类型</a> 提到的衰减迷雾在渲染层的落地——状态机拓扑不变，只是显示值连续化了。注意时间平滑只影响<strong>渲染</strong>，逻辑可见性仍是离散的硬判定——否则会出现「视觉上还半亮、逻辑上已不可见」被玩家误判的情况，这条「渲染可滞后、逻辑不可」的原则与 <a href=\"../systems/visibility-unit-culling\">可见性与单位剔除</a> 一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三态的明暗与色彩\">三态的明暗与色彩</h2><p>三态在屏幕上要一眼可辨。约定俗成的映射是：<strong>可见</strong>——全亮，地形和单位正常显示；<strong>已探索</strong>——压暗并去饱和（常乘一个 0.4–0.6 的亮度系数 + 轻微冷色调），让玩家知道「这是记忆，不是现在」；<strong>未探索</strong>——纯黑或接近纯黑。着色器里用可见度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 和已探索位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 做两段混合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[采样 v 当前可见度, e 已探索] --&gt; B{e == 0?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是 未探索| C[输出 纯黑]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[在 已探索灰 与 可见亮 间按 v 插值]&#10;    D --&gt; E[lerp 灰色, 原色, v]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可选: 已探索区叠冷色/降饱和]\">flowchart TD\n    A[采样 v 当前可见度, e 已探索] --&gt; B{e == 0?}\n    B --&gt;|是 未探索| C[输出 纯黑]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[在 已探索灰 与 可见亮 间按 v 插值]\n    D --&gt; E[lerp 灰色, 原色, v]\n    E --&gt; F[可选: 已探索区叠冷色/降饱和]</pre><p>这里有个表现陷阱：已探索区里的敌方单位<strong>鬼影</strong>该怎么画。它们是来自三态模型的快照（最后已知位置），应渲染成半透明灰色、不带血条不带实时动画，明确传达「这是你记忆里的它，未必还在」。绝不能用实时数据画它们——那等于渲染层透视，与 <a href=\"../systems/fog-anti-cheat\">迷雾与反作弊</a> 的红线冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2d-与-3d-迷雾的不同落地\">2D 与 3D 迷雾的不同落地</h2><p>迷雾渲染的具体技法随维度分叉。<strong>2D/俯视 RTS</strong>：迷雾是叠在地图上的一层全屏 quad，采样可见性纹理后用乘法/alpha 混合压暗地图——实现轻量，主要工作在纹理与边缘柔化。<strong>3D 迷雾</strong>：要把可见性投射到三维世界，常用做法是把可见性纹理当作一张俯视的「遮罩贴图」，在地形和物体的着色器里按世界坐标采样它来决定明暗；更高级的会用体积雾（volumetric fog）让迷雾有真实的空间厚度和光散射。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[迷雾渲染] --&gt; B[2D/俯视]&#10;    A --&gt; C[3D]&#10;    B --&gt; D[全屏 quad 叠加&lt;br/&gt;采样可见性纹理混合]&#10;    C --&gt; E[世界坐标采样遮罩贴图]&#10;    C --&gt; F[体积雾 真实厚度+散射]&#10;    E --&gt; G[地形/物体着色器按可见度调暗]\">flowchart TD\n    A[迷雾渲染] --&gt; B[2D/俯视]\n    A --&gt; C[3D]\n    B --&gt; D[全屏 quad 叠加&lt;br/&gt;采样可见性纹理混合]\n    C --&gt; E[世界坐标采样遮罩贴图]\n    C --&gt; F[体积雾 真实厚度+散射]\n    E --&gt; G[地形/物体着色器按可见度调暗]</pre><p>3D 体积雾会牵扯到光照与散射模型，那属于图形学范畴，见 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/lighting-models\">游戏图形的光照模型（04）</a>；本 hub 只讲「可见性如何驱动迷雾的明暗」，不展开通用体积渲染。无论 2D 还是 3D，渲染的开销（全屏混合、采样、体积步进）都进入帧预算，归 <a href=\"visibility-performance\">可见性性能</a> 统筹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>迷雾渲染把离散三态网格变成柔和的视觉层：核心是可见性纹理 + GPU 双线性采样，把方格抹成梯度。</li>\n<li>可见性纹理常低于屏幕分辨率，分辨率是「贴地形 vs 柔和」的旋钮，可叠噪声做不规则边缘；可复用 GPU 可见性场省回传。</li>\n<li>时间平滑让视野过渡呼吸（指数缓动到目标可见度），但只作用于渲染层，逻辑可见性仍是硬判定。</li>\n<li>三态映射为亮/灰去饱和/黑，已探索区敌方画半透明鬼影（用快照不用实时），否则等于渲染层透视。</li>\n<li>2D 用全屏 quad 叠加，3D 用世界坐标采样遮罩贴图或体积雾；体积渲染细节归图形学，本 hub 只讲可见性驱动明暗。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：渲染开销纳入 <a href=\"visibility-performance\">可见性性能</a> 的帧预算；视觉对玩法体验的影响见 <a href=\"fog-game-feel\">迷雾的玩法表现</a>。</li>\n<li>基础与计算：渲染对象是 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a> 的三态，衰减来自 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-of-war-types\">战争迷雾类型</a>；纹理可由 <a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 直接产出。</li>\n<li>跨库：体积雾的光照散射见 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/lighting-models\">游戏图形的光照模型</a>；与相机取景的分工见 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/framing-control/framing-composition\">相机系统的取景构图</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迷雾渲染","id":"迷雾渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可见性纹理与双线性采样","id":"可见性纹理与双线性采样"},{"level":2,"text":"时间平滑：让视野呼吸","id":"时间平滑-让视野呼吸"},{"level":2,"text":"三态的明暗与色彩","id":"三态的明暗与色彩"},{"level":2,"text":"2D 与 3D 迷雾的不同落地","id":"2d-与-3d-迷雾的不同落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"可见性与单位剔除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/systems/visibility-unit-culling"},"next":{"title":"可见性性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/practice/visibility-performance"}}